<title>SPAIN: Viscofan pre-tax profit 714 million pesetas.</title>
<headline>Viscofan pre-tax profit 714 million pesetas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first half in millions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			    714     vs	661</p>
<p> Net turnover			  24,702     vs   23,156</p>
<p> Operating result		     1,934     vs    1,880</p>
<p>NOTE - Spanish sausage-maker Viscofan said profit attributable to the mother group was 806 million pesetas, up from 734 million in 1995. Investment rose to 3.3 billion pesetas but will drop sharply in the second half and in 1997.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
